@startuml C4-L1-SystemContext
title KnowledgeOS — C4 Level 1 — System Context
caption Architecture V3.0 — Master Library and Personal Sync Profile

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "User" as user
rectangle "KnowledgeOS Clients\nmacOS / iPhone / iPad" as clients
node "KnowledgeOS Server\non NAS" as server
database "NAS Master Library\nMaster Catalog + Source Publications" as master
cloud "iCloud / CloudKit\nPersonal State Synchronization" as icloud
cloud "Optional External Services\nAI / OCR / Export" as external

user --> clients : Reads, annotates and manages local knowledge
clients --> server : Browse Master Catalog and acquire publications
server <--> master : Manages master catalog and source publications
clients <--> icloud : Synchronize personal state among Apple devices
clients --> external : Optional governed requests

note right of master
  No personal annotations,
  reading progress or personal
  knowledge state are stored here.
end note

note bottom of clients
  Each device has a selective local Library.
  It is not a replica of the NAS Master Library.
end note

footer KnowledgeOS Architecture | C4 Model | Version 3.0
@enduml
